      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TAT LEAH (1) is going well, finishing in the placings twice in a row. Not beaten far last time when a 1.75 lengths third (25.41) in a Grade 5 at this track. This looks easier and expected to bounce back. ASTON FIXER (3) is an honest type who is lining up for his first start here. Comes here an impressive winner latest at Warrnambool in Grade 5 in one of the quickest times of the program (25.13). Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Deserves serious consideration again. TRAVIS INTENTION (8) finished third last time (28.40) at Bendigo after winning at his previous two outings. The form out of his last race has been franked. Will give a great sight again. MAX EFFORT (6) showed plenty of dash to record a last start win. Right in the mix.",
